{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 152, "line_no": 2, "text": "“做祧”是黔南荔波一带的布依族以求生育、保佑子女为目的的宗教仪式，属傩仪范", "bbox_px": {"x": 181, "y": 262, "w": 1467, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "“做祧”是黔南荔波一带的布依族以求生育、保佑子女为目的的宗教仪式，属傩仪范", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 181, "y": 262, "w": 1467, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 152, "line_no": 3, "text": "畴。仪式一般要进行七天七夜，祭三十六位神祇，其中有属于人鬼系统的神祇，也有属于", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 330, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "畴。仪式一般要进行七天七夜，祭三十六位神祇，其中有属于人鬼系统的神祇，也有属于", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 330, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 152, "line_no": 4, "text": "自然神鬼系统的神祇。仪式由布摩念经，每段经文唱述一个神祇，主要叙述其来历及特", "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 394, "w": 1540, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "自然神鬼系统的神祇。仪式由布摩念经，每段经文唱述一个神祇，主要叙述其来历及特", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 394, "w": 1540, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 152, "line_no": 5, "text": "点。三十六位神祇均有偶像，他们神态各异，性格鲜明，司职各有分工。据说最初每个男", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 459, "w": 1540, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "点。三十六位神祇均有偶像，他们神态各异，性格鲜明，司职各有分工。据说最初每个男", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 459, "w": 1540, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 152, "line_no": 6, "text": "性的一生中都必须要举行一次，后来部分地区演变为婚后不生育者方才举行，一般人则", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 519, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "性的一生中都必须要举行一次，后来部分地区演变为婚后不生育者方才举行，一般人则", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 519, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 152, "line_no": 7, "text": "可做可不做。①", "bbox_px": {"x": 104, "y": 575, "w": 270, "h": 62}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "可做可不做。①", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 104, "y": 575, "w": 270, "h": 62}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 152, "line_no": 8, "text": "（三）“殡亡”和“罕王”仪式", "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 648, "w": 486, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（三）“殡亡”和“罕王”仪式", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 648, "w": 486, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 152, "line_no": 9, "text": "“殡亡”是布依语［pijan’va:n”］的音译，“殡”［pjan’］的意思是“超度”，“亡”［va：”］的", "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 716, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "“殡亡”是布依语［pijan’va:n”］的音译，“殡”［pjan’］的意思是“超度”，“亡”［va：”］的", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 716, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 152, "line_no": 10, "text": "意思是鬼、亡灵。“殡亡”是摩教仪式中较为隆重的一种。在镇宁一带，则称次“古谢”，意", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 785, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "意思是鬼、亡灵。“殡亡”是摩教仪式中较为隆重的一种。在镇宁一带，则称次“古谢”，意", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 785, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 152, "line_no": 11, "text": "思是“做客”，取丧葬仪式活动客人多之意。此外，民间还有“做嘎”、“赶嘎”", "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 841, "w": 1319, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "思是“做客”，取丧葬仪式活动客人多之意。此外，民间还有“做嘎”、“赶嘎”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 841, "w": 1319, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
