{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 152, "line_no": 14, "text": "要包括请师、祭棺、开丧、转场、送仙、嘱咐等几个主要仪式。根据布依族摩教信仰，人死", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 982, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "要包括请师、祭棺、开丧、转场、送仙、嘱咐等几个主要仪式。根据布依族摩教信仰，人死", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 982, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 152, "line_no": 15, "text": "后必须通过举行“殡亡”仪式，亡魂才能循着布摩指引的路径，顺利通往极乐世界“旁仙”、", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1042, "w": 1552, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "后必须通过举行“殡亡”仪式，亡魂才能循着布摩指引的路径，顺利通往极乐世界“旁仙”、", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1042, "w": 1552, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 152, "line_no": 16, "text": "“旁拜”。", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1106, "w": 161, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "“旁拜”。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1106, "w": 161, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
